{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":417,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1906863,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280673,"Name":"mzcanizales","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1445981132,"LastPoster":{"Id":284817,"Name":"kelbiiztd","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1906863,"PostDate":1445981132,"PostContent":"So I believe I found the travel agent that we want to work with on all of the travel arrangements...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mzcanizales16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.83.68.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413502123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mzcanizales","Id":280673,"Name":"mzcanizales","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.81.216.8","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f48136315f69f454aad625502428c63f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I believe I found the travel agent that we want to work with on all of the travel arrangements for our guests and ourselves.&amp;nbsp;We are having a meeting with her on Saturday.&amp;nbsp; What should be some questions we ask her?&amp;nbsp; TYIA&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906863,"PostDate":1445981132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I believe I found the travel agent that we want to work with on all of the travel arrangements for our guests and ourselves.\u00a0We are having a meeting with her on Saturday.\u00a0 What should be some questions we ask her?\u00a0 TYIA<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mzcanizales16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.83.68.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413502123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mzcanizales","Id":280673,"Name":"mzcanizales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ae3c16cbab555675ec3580a168bf417","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to the site! Getting a TA is definitely something that is recommended, if only for your own sanity in the planning process. Your TA will become your new bff as you go through your planning journey. Try to see if there are people willing to provide a reference or references. Can the TA provide any? As about response time for questions - how long do they usually take to reply? Have they handled a lot of weddings? What is their experience level with large groups?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You don&#039;t say if you&#039;re in the US or canada - the questions might vary a little depending on where you are. Is there a fee they charge for their services? If you&#039;re in the US will they be helping guests find separate flights? Are they a top award agency with any of the resort chains? Are they certified for any of the resort chains - the owners of this site are Karisma certified agents and are top award winners.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sure some of the other ladies will chime in with other questions they asked as well. Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906870,"PostDate":1445994854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to the site! Getting a TA is definitely something that is recommended, if only for your own sanity in the planning process. Your TA will become your new bff as you go through your planning journey. Try to see if there are people willing to provide a reference or references. Can the TA provide any? As about response time for questions - how long do they usually take to reply? Have they handled a lot of weddings? What is their experience level with large groups?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You don't say if you're in the US or canada - the questions might vary a little depending on where you are. Is there a fee they charge for their services? If you're in the US will they be helping guests find separate flights? Are they a top award agency with any of the resort chains? Are they certified for any of the resort chains - the owners of this site are Karisma certified agents and are top award winners.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm sure some of the other ladies will chime in with other questions they asked as well. Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.9.56.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1022972a2f4b3f1e8a2e06fd8f3a39d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strike&gt;Congrats.. I can say you need to make sure first that know as much info about your resort you are wanting to have your wedding at and the destation as well. And is willing to answer all your questions. If you need to see about group booking sometimes you get great deals that way. And will they also help your guest wtih there travel needs. If some of your guest have not traveled that much they will need to know all the rules of the airline and what all they get at the resort. So having a travel agent that will take there time to answer questions is the best. I hope this helps some.&lt;\/strike&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906897,"PostDate":1446032135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strike>Congrats.. I can say you need to make sure first that know as much info about your resort you are wanting to have your wedding at and the destation as well. And is willing to answer all your questions. If you need to see about group booking sometimes you get great deals that way. And will they also help your guest wtih there travel needs. If some of your guest have not traveled that much they will need to know all the rules of the airline and what all they get at the resort. So having a travel agent that will take there time to answer questions is the best. I hope this helps some.<\/strike><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440294410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.166.34.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"821c1e5b7c2c0aa5f91dda733c3c5f32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, mzcanizales, and Congrats on your dw!!! You&#039;re sure to find lots of great info here - to help with your planning questions and get you going in the right direction :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;d be great to hear more about where you&#039;re from, where you&#039;re getting married, etc :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.....to ramp up your creativity even more .....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Timeline Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11228135_10153678335969487_654819939588563704_o.jpg\" alt=\"11228135_10153678335969487_6548199395885\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/12087256_10153658670984487_219854954419263618_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087256_10153658670984487_2198549544192\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949483703_o.jpg\" alt=\"11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope it all works out just the way you envision - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906912,"PostDate":1446053886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, mzcanizales, and Congrats on your dw!!! You're sure to find lots of great info here - to help with your planning questions and get you going in the right direction <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It'd be great to hear more about where you're from, where you're getting married, etc <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.....to ramp up your creativity even more .....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timeline Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11228135_10153678335969487_654819939588563704_o.jpg\" alt=\"11228135_10153678335969487_6548199395885\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/12087256_10153658670984487_219854954419263618_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087256_10153658670984487_2198549544192\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949483703_o.jpg\" alt=\"11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope it all works out just the way you envision - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.79.44.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2a885ffebc4ca5ebf7f4f08090394d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"mzcanizales\"] ,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I met with my travel agent I had a list of resorts that I was looking into so I asked about her experience with those resorts what she knows about them and what the previous brides and their guests thought about them. &amp;nbsp;She was able to show me pictures of weddings at the resorts and pictures from her recent visits at the resorts. I also asked her about wedding party size, what was the largest party she had to book for and what the entire process was like. I also asked about the benefits of using an agent. My agent impressed me during the initial meeting and she has been very good at responding to e-mails quickly. I felt much better after meeting with her and she is currently planning a trip for me and my fiance to visit 3 resorts in January. Good luck with your meeting!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906945,"PostDate":1446159077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280673\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280673-mzcanizales\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mzcanizales<\/span><\/a> ,<\/p>\n<p>When I met with my travel agent I had a list of resorts that I was looking into so I asked about her experience with those resorts what she knows about them and what the previous brides and their guests thought about them. \u00a0She was able to show me pictures of weddings at the resorts and pictures from her recent visits at the resorts. I also asked her about wedding party size, what was the largest party she had to book for and what the entire process was like. I also asked about the benefits of using an agent. My agent impressed me during the initial meeting and she has been very good at responding to e-mails quickly. I felt much better after meeting with her and she is currently planning a trip for me and my fiance to visit 3 resorts in January. Good luck with your meeting!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427042404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1444096181","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.81.216.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e294f7cbb01f75a95f3b2423e87e0ab1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks! The agent we met with really impressed me.&amp;nbsp; The information she gave at times, though sounded too good to be true.&amp;nbsp; For instance, she said if we were having difficulty getting our guests to get their down payments in, she would offer an incentive i.e. if you are to get your deposit in by this date your name will be added to a drawing for $250.&amp;nbsp; She said that money would come out of her pocket.&amp;nbsp; Plus she owns this business by herself and works out of her home.&amp;nbsp; In the contract she provided, she requested our credit card info to make the payment to book her.&amp;nbsp; My fiance&amp;nbsp;is a little leary just because she does work out&amp;nbsp;of her&amp;nbsp;home and&amp;nbsp;all of our correspondence would be thru email and the phone.&amp;nbsp; I did meet her at a bridal show, so that does ease my fears a little. &amp;nbsp; Is all this normal tactics?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve tried to find reviews about her other than the ones on her website, but cant find anything.&amp;nbsp; She is listed on the BBB, but with no reviews.&amp;nbsp; I really liked her but my fiance is a little sketchy and I totally understand why. Please help !&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907150,"PostDate":1446663134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks! The agent we met with really impressed me.\u00a0 The information she gave at times, though sounded too good to be true.\u00a0 For instance, she said if we were having difficulty getting our guests to get their down payments in, she would offer an incentive i.e. if you are to get your deposit in by this date your name will be added to a drawing for $250.\u00a0 She said that money would come out of her pocket.\u00a0 Plus she owns this business by herself and works out of her home.\u00a0 In the contract she provided, she requested our credit card info to make the payment to book her.\u00a0 My fiance\u00a0is a little leary just because she does work out\u00a0of her\u00a0home and\u00a0all of our correspondence would be thru email and the phone.\u00a0 I did meet her at a bridal show, so that does ease my fears a little. \u00a0 Is all this normal tactics?\u00a0 I've tried to find reviews about her other than the ones on her website, but cant find anything.\u00a0 She is listed on the BBB, but with no reviews.\u00a0 I really liked her but my fiance is a little sketchy and I totally understand why. Please help !<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mzcanizales16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.83.68.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413502123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mzcanizales","Id":280673,"Name":"mzcanizales","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.79.44.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"136d837fa060ab2754a46af0835c54c5","RawContent":"@[member=\"mzcanizales\"] is the fee that she&#039;s charging you refundable at all? I thought with travel agents they usually font charge anything up front and if they do its refundable or it goes toward your wedding or something like that.","Attachments":[],"Id":1907616,"PostDate":1447711768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280673\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280673-mzcanizales\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mzcanizales<\/span><\/a> is the fee that she's charging you refundable at all? I thought with travel agents they usually font charge anything up front and if they do its refundable or it goes toward your wedding or something like that.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427042404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1444096181","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.79.44.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79684,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b4870d3a91fbd7b888002c6215dd986","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tiffanyt\" post=\"1907616\" timestamp=\"1447711768\"]\n@[member=\"mzcanizales\"] is the fee that she&#039;s charging you refundable at all? I thought with travel agents they usually font charge anything up front and if they do its refundable or it goes toward your wedding or something like that.[\/quote]\n*don&#039;t","Attachments":[],"Id":1907655,"PostDate":1447811440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tiffanyt, on 16 November 2015 - 02:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard