Key":"85ecadcd5eb8a15b743edb57008e88af","RawContent":"New questions on wedding at Dreams.... What is with the cost for a ceremony on the beach? Does anyone have any pics of the location and if it is private? \n \n Also, I see that you can have your dinner reception on the beach also.... is there an extra charge for that location on top of the dinner pricing? Is it nice? Or is it a pain? \n \n I am wondering if I should just have it in the gazebo and then the reception somewhere else on resort... Anyone have pics of the reception locations?\n \n We have about 30 people and I would like it to be outside..","Attachments":[],"Id":259661,"PostDate":1207733012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                New questions on wedding at Dreams.... What is with the cost for a ceremony on the beach? Does anyone have any pics of the location and if it is private? <br \/> <br \/> Also, I see that you can have your dinner reception on the beach also.... is there an extra charge for that location on top of the dinner pricing? Is it nice? Or is it a pain? <br \/> <br \/> I am wondering if I should just have it in the gazebo and then the reception somewhere else on resort... Anyone have pics of the reception locations?<br \/> <br \/> We have about 30 people and I would like it to be outside..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>visit my wedsite @ <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/web.mac.com\/kimlemire\/Lemire_Lennon_wedsite\/How_we_